#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:6
msgid "$if"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$if(condition,then[,else])**"
msgstr "用法：**$if(condition,then[,else])**"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:9
msgid "Category: conditional"
msgstr "类别：条件"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:13
msgid "If ``condition`` is not empty it returns ``then``, otherwise it returns ``else``. If ``else`` is not provided, it will be assumed to be an empty string. In addition to (or instead of) returning values, ``then`` and ``else`` can be used to conditionally execute other functions."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``condition`` 不为空，则返回 ``then``，否则返回 ``else``。如果未提供 "
"``else``，则假定其为空字符串。除了返回值之外（或作为返回值的替代），可以使用 "
"``then`` 和 ``else`` 来有条件地执行其他函数。"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:19
msgid "Formatting the code using characters such as spaces, tabs or newlines can affect the result of the function."
msgstr "使用空格、制表符或换行符等字符格式化代码可能会影响函数的结果。"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:21
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_if.rst:23
msgid "The following statements will return the values indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将返回指示的值："
